    narr:narration """The trajectory of this hub centers on the [core product differentiator](narr:Position_CoreFeatureDecisionCapture), which defines the system by its ability to capture decision artifacts at the point of consensus. This foundational framing, established in March 2026, has recently been bridged to concrete delivery milestones. As of July 2026, the team reports the [successful shipment of the async decision widget](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784888061891_1), framing this milestone alongside the [Zephyr integration](narr:Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784888061891_3) as the critical technical unlock. The discourse remains focused on competence and communal sharing, moving from the abstract definition of the capture mechanism to the specific technical dependencies that enabled its realization. The [team's internal framing](narr:Position_SprintDeliveryAndUnlock) continues to interrogate how these specific shipments align with the broader goal of capturing consensus.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2ETanyaCollab1784888061891_1> ;
